      "comment": "EVIL EYE (6) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was too tough when scoring last time over 300m at this track in a Free For All (16.58). Form here at the trip sound including 17 wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Great chance again. LADY GUNAI (7) had been racing in honest fashion recording four placings in a row before finishing fifth (19.37) at this track latest. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. ELECTRA OPAL (4) started big odds over 300m at this track (16.72) in Free For All but ran very well to fill a minor placing. Was a winner the start prior in easier at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 12 races. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature. FROZEN WINTER (2) won in smart time most recently. Worth consideration.",
